WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
Ryu falls from the light-Bushin prerequisite.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.150
The crouching jab intentionally whiffs.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.300
Standing heavy kick trades with Ryu’s recorded jab.

4
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.000
Standing heavy punch links after the trade.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Heavy Vagabond Edge launches Ryu.

6
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.850
The air grab converts the trade juggle.

7
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.150
The trade branch finishes in hard knockdown.
